This licence covers the code in this repository only.

Nothing that setup downloads is covered by it, and two of those have their own
terms worth knowing about:

  Live2D Cubism Core  — fetched from Live2D's CDN at setup time and never
                        redistributed here. Free for small-scale and personal
                        use under Live2D's own licence; commercial use above
                        their revenue threshold requires a licence from them.
                        https://www.live2d.com/en/sdk/license/

  Haru                 — a Live2D sample character, fetched at setup time.
                        Live2D's sample data terms apply, and they are not the
                        same as the SDK terms. Fine for personal use; check
                        before shipping anything with her in it.

  Kokoro-82M (TTS)     — Apache 2.0.
  Silero VAD           — MIT.
  faster-whisper       — MIT, wrapping OpenAI's Whisper weights (MIT).

If you add your own Live2D character, its licence is between you and whoever
made it. See docs/CHARACTERS.md.
